1391.description:
The confrontation between good and evil can sometimes raise doubts regarding the appearance and participants in the conflict. The fact is that sometimes evil itself becomes a propagandist for the conflict between good and evil, meaning the dark side acquires bright, bright intentions. A game called King's Bounty: Dark Side exemplifies this strange balance of power. It tells the story of how the forces of light have lost control and are now oppressing and tormenting the defeated peoples of darkness. Players will have to rise to the defense of these peoples and, together with their generals, fight back against the forces of light. Three great warriors: the head of an orc tribe named Bagyr, the charming and cunning demoness Neolina, and the sensible vampire Daert, are ready to join forces and save their peoples, and you will become their faithful companion, striving to do everything in your power to achieve success. The forces of light have created a vast army; it's time for them to show that in war, it's not numbers that decide, but unity and self-confidence.

Game features:
- This time you will have to thoroughly study the skills of your heroes, since they belong to a completely different balance of forces and have a lot of new possibilities, but one point is still worth considering, which concerns the diversification of development, only in this way you will be able to create a universal hero;
- King's Bounty Dark Side will once again offer its players a long adventure, which will be divided into 5 huge territories with their own characteristics, unique structures and an abundance of various quests, allowing you to explore every corner of the world and talk to a variety of NPCs with unique stories, special rewards and pieces of the history of this world;
- if you decide to download a torrent King's Bounty Dark Side, then you'll find a completely new interpretation of a familiar adventure, which this time will be filled with dark heroes, interesting twists, and even some intersections with past storylines. Three unique heroes of evil and darkness will rise up to eradicate the forces of light, as they violate freedom and engage in active genocide against the populations of their lands.

